          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most homes, the Frigidaire FHDD5034Y1 is the smart dehumidifier to buy: a genuine current-test 50 pint unit with a big bucket, a 41°F rating and an app that covers remote humidity, schedules and Alexa and Google. TCL's H50D44W does nearly the same for less, and for a basement without a floor drain, the TCL H50D46W or the Midea Cube with its 16 foot pump removes the bucket chore that most app alerts exist to nag you about.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
